Tool response:
Tool: create_new_recipe_version
Description: Creates a new version of the specified recipe.
Copies existing ingredients and steps from the previous active version (if any) 
but allows updates to yield, suppliers, and steps via subsequent calls or logic.
The new version becomes the active version.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "recipe_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Recipe Id",
          "description": ""
        },
        "version_number": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Version Number"
        },
        "total_yield_quantity": {
          "type": "number",
          "title": "Total Yield Quantity"
        },
        "total_yield_unit": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Total Yield Unit"
        },
        "change_summary": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Change Summary"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "recipe_id",
        "version_number",
        "total_yield_quantity",
        "total_yield_unit"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: update_recipe_version_ingredient_supplier
Description: Updates the supplier for an ingredient in a specific recipe version.
Deactivates the current assignment and creates/updates with new supplier.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "recipe_version_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Recipe Version Id",
          "description": ""
        },
        "ingredient_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Ingredient Id",
          "description": ""
        },
        "supplier_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Supplier Id"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "recipe_version_id",
        "ingredient_id",
        "supplier_id"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: add_recipe_step
Description: Adds a new step to a recipe version at the next available step number.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "recipe_version_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Recipe Version Id",
          "description": ""
        },
        "instruction": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Instruction"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "recipe_version_id",
        "instruction"
      ]
    }
